    "goal": "Extrude bioink through the cryo-3 (500 µm) nozzle along a 30351 µm G-code path at 37.26 mm/min and report the deposition rate (nL/min).",
    "rationale": "Deposition rate is the extruded volume per unit time. Extruded volume = π(d/2)²·L for the 500 µm nozzle over the 30351 µm path; print time = L/v at 37.26 mm/min. Deposition rate = volume/time, equivalently nozzle cross-section × feed rate. Footprint (11516 µm) and pitch (480 µm) determine fill line count (24 lines) but do not affect the per-pass deposition rate.",
